# Slither for CI (job "slither" in .github/workflows/ci.yml). One pinned tool; the .txt next to this file pins every
# package it needs, with hashes. Regenerate after a deliberate bump (uv 0.13.1; wheels only, as the CI image has no compiler):
#   uv pip compile scripts/ci/requirements-slither.in --generate-hashes --python-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu \
#     --python-version 3.12 --only-binary :all: --no-header -o scripts/ci/requirements-slither.txt
